<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="e7b3d1a5-1778-4c2e-9f40-8a6b2c5d7e91" version="1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Hawaii 1778</Name>
    <Teaser>The Hawaiian Islands on the eve of contact: five chiefdoms, three lesser islands, one natural wonder per island.</Teaser>
    <Description>The Hawaiian Islands in 1778, on a 148x114 hex map (4 km per hex) built from NOAA ETOPO 2022 relief: trade-wind rainforest to windward, dry coasts to leeward, snow on Mauna Kea. Kamehameha's Kona and Keoua's Hilo share the Big Island; Kahekili's Maui, Kahahana's Oahu and Kamakahelei's Kauai each start from a Settler and a Warrior in the Ancient era; Molokai, Lanai and Niihau are city-states. One natural wonder per island (Mauna Kea, Kilauea, Haleakala, Leahi, Waimea Canyon, Kalaupapa, Keahiakawelo), no iron and no horses, stock rules, normal barbarians, Standard speed, one turn = one year, development capped at the Classical era, domination victory only. Start it from Mods, Single Player, Scenarios.</Description>
    <Authors>cryptoboy2283</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>NOAA ETOPO 2022, Civ5MapImage, Black Forest Labs FLUX (leader art)</SpecialThanks>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
    <MinCompatibleSaveVersion>0</MinCompatibleSaveVersion>
    <SupportsSinglePlayer>1</SupportsSinglePlayer>
    <SupportsMultiplayer>0</SupportsMultiplayer>
